      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "IMPLEMENTATION GATES: trusted caller identity; machine-read authorization; independent approval; private runtime connectivity.\nHuman access stays officer-specific. Processing identities and approval authority need authorization; live cross-officer tests are not yet run.\nTarget design - not an as-built inventory. No Container Apps hosting.",
      "originalText": "IMPLEMENTATION GATES: trusted caller identity; machine-read authorization; independent approval; private runtime connectivity.\nHuman access stays officer-specific. Processing identities and approval authority need authorization; live cross-officer tests are not yet run.\nTarget design - not an as-built inventory. No Container Apps hosting.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
